{"t":"097950.KS","n":"CJ Cheiljedang Corporation","nKo":"CJ제일제당","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":180200.0,"chg":4200.0,"chgPct":0.02386,"prev":176000.0,"dayH":180800.0,"dayL":174300.0,"w52H":252000.0,"w52L":168600.0,"vol":40041,"avgVol":44491,"mcap":2887377485824,"pe":null,"fpe":7.03,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":6000.0,"divY":0.0341,"beta":0.12,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Consumer Defensive","sKo":"소비자 방어","i":"Packaged Foods","iKo":"포장식품","city":"Seoul","emp":null,"web":"https://www.cj.co.kr","sum":"CJ Cheiljedang Corporation engages in the food business in South Korea and internationally. It operates through Food, Biotechnology, Feed and Care, and Logistics segments. The company offers home meal replacement, meat/fishery processing, seasoning/sauce, sweetener/flour/oil, and seaweed/dessert/snack/beverage products. It also provides amino acid, green protein, enzyme, plant nutrition and health, and specialty solution; biopolymer solution; and polyhydroxyalkanoate products. In addition, the company offers taste and nutrition solutions. Further, it engages in the feed, livestock, and fresh meat business; and logistics services, including transportation, construction, storage, shipping, and discharging. The company serves under the bibigo, Hetbahn, Gourmet, Beksul, The Healthy, DASIDA, Ha","sumKo":"CJ제일제당은 국내외 식품사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 식품, 생명공학, 사료 및 관리, 물류 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 가정간편식, 육류/수산물 가공, 조미료/소스, 감미료/밀가루/기름, 김/디저트/스낵/음료 등을 제공하는 회사입니다. 또한 아미노산, 녹색 단백질, 효소, 식물 영양 및 건강, 특수 솔루션을 제공합니다. 생체고분자 용액; 및 폴리하이드록시알카노에이트 제품. 또한 맛과 영양 솔루션도 제공하고 있습니다. 또한 사료, 축산, 신선육 사업도 영위하고 있습니다. 운송, 건설, 보관, 운송 및 하역을 포함한 물류 서비스. 회사는 비비고, 햇반, 미식가, 백설, 더헬시, 다시다, 하 등의 계열사를 두고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":30079513000000,"ni":595930000000},{"y":2023,"rev":29023473000000,"ni":385927000000},{"y":2024,"rev":29359082000000,"ni":148181000000},{"y":2025,"rev":27342589000000,"ni":-572401000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":7005702000000